---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const href = "https://h.xinhuaxmt.com/vh512/share/12405384?d=134fe64&channel=weixin&time=1789485809413";
---
<article class="lantern-feature" id="lantern" aria-labelledby="lantern-heading">
  <div class="lantern-cover">
    <img src={`${base}assets/elements/lantern-shot-sky.png`} alt="花灯缘动画画面：小元手捧花灯，仰望夜空" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="lantern-cover-copy"><p>新华社合作项目 / AIGC 元宵节动画</p><h2 id="lantern-heading">花灯缘</h2><p class="lantern-line">一盏鱼灯，照见团圆。</p><a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">观看完整作品 <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="lantern-editorial">
    <div><p class="lantern-label">关于作品</p><h3>灯火阑珊处，<br />总有人在等你归来。</h3><p>与新华社合作的 AIGC 元宵节动画，以安徽村落的鱼灯习俗为线索，讲述小元与爷爷跨越古今的团圆故事。</p><div class="lantern-credit"><strong>100 万＋</strong><span>新华社官网播放量<br />据项目作品集资料</span></div></div>
    <div><p class="lantern-label">故事脉络</p><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h4>一同做灯</h4><p>小元起初不理解爷爷制作鱼灯的执着。</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h4>走进灯会</h4><p>和伙伴看灯、赏烟花，逐渐读懂元宵习俗与手艺人的坚守。</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h4>灯下团圆</h4><p>在灯会结尾与爷爷相聚，镜头转向古今两个小元的身影。时代向前，亲情与非遗传承始终相连。</p></div></li></ol></div>
  </div>
</article>
<style>
  .lantern-feature { grid-column: 1/-1; background: #f7f8fa; color: #181e23; }
  .lantern-cover { position: relative; height: 640px; overflow: hidden; }
  .lantern-cover>img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }
  .lantern-cover::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#101b24db 0%,#101b2460 38%,transparent 65%); }
  .lantern-cover-copy { position: absolute; z-index: 1; left: 5%; bottom: 10%; color: white; }
  .lantern-cover-copy>p { font-size: 13px; }.lantern-cover-copy h2 { font-size: 82px; line-height: 1.3; margin: 15px 0; }
  .lantern-cover-copy .lantern-line { font-size: 20px; }
  .lantern-cover-copy a { display: inline-flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; margin-top: 30px; min-height: 48px; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #fff; font-size: 15px; }
  a svg { width: 22px; } a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #cbff5e; outline-offset: 5px; }
  .lantern-editorial { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10%; padding: 46px 5%; }
  .lantern-label { color: #697781; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  h3 { font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .lantern-editorial p:not(.lantern-label) { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .lantern-credit { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .lantern-credit strong { font-size: 32px; color: #005c65; }.lantern-credit span { font-size: 11px; color: #67737a; line-height: 1.6; }
  ol { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; } li { display: flex; gap: 22px; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid #cbd0d4; } li>span { font-size: 12px; color: #005c65; padding-top: 4px; } h4 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  @media(max-width:700px) { .lantern-cover { height: 480px; }.lantern-cover>img { object-position: 48% center; } .lantern-cover::after { background: linear-gradient(transparent 20%,#101b24dc); }.lantern-cover-copy { left: 6%; bottom: 6%; }.lantern-cover-copy h2 { font-size: 56px; }.lantern-editorial { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; padding: 32px 6%; } h3 { font-size: 25px; } }
</style>
